meta {
  name: Get Jadwal Kegiatan
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/proposals/:id/jadwal
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: your-proposal-uuid-here
}

docs {
  # GET /api/proposals/:id/jadwal

  Mengambil daftar jadwal kegiatan penelitian/pengabdian dari sebuah proposal.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Description |
  |-----------|------|-------------|
  | id | UUID | ID proposal |

  ## Response Success (200)

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Data jadwal berhasil diambil",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "proposal_id": "proposal-uuid",
        "urutan": 1,
        "kegiatan": "Studi Literatur",
        "bulan_mulai": 1,
        "bulan_selesai": 2,
        "createdAt": "2025-01-08T00:00:00.000Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "proposal_id": "proposal-uuid",
        "urutan": 2,
        "kegiatan": "Pengumpulan Data",
        "bulan_mulai": 3,
        "bulan_selesai": 5,
        "createdAt": "2025-01-08T00:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Error Responses

  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|
  | 403 | Tidak memiliki akses ke proposal ini |
  | 404 | Proposal tidak ditemukan |
}
